{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;One More Level&gt;&gt;is a relaxed and enjoyable tower breaking game, which not only has a rich equipment system but also various fascinating storylines, Various random events are irresistible, and if you are a game enthusiast, it will be a blessing for you. Playing it will make you addicted!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1\u3001Rich equipment system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, each piece of equipment not only has exclusive special effects, but also a star rating system similar to that of a heavy mech soldier, which gives a great sense of achievement when it comes to obtaining three-star equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a2-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a3-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2\u3001Innovative reinforcement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you can collect strengthening stones to create your own unique equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a4-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a5-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3\u3001Colorful synthesis system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you can collect various materials to synthesize various props and equipment that are beneficial for battles, making adventures easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a6-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a7-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4\u3001Exciting exchange system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you can collect various rare items such as dragon crystals to exchange for super rare items, which brings a great sense of happiness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/extras/a10-1.png?t=1748500619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5\u3001 Author's words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the above gameplay, there are dozens of exciting gameplay options in the game. Come and experience them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6\u3001 Official communication group</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Further official communication group:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">219808752</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2405360?t=1748500619","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/47fbda6c7d18b8c19aaffc67593d96209f40400e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748500619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/94d4e21352fb4256890c5f43a40de5e1db831555/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748500619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405360/94d4e21352fb4256890c5f43a40de5e1db831555/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748500619","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;&lt;One More Level&gt;&gt;is a relaxed and enjoyable tower breaking game, which not only has a rich equipment system but also various fascinating storylines, Various random events are irresistible, and if you are a game enthusiast, it will be a blessing for you. Playing it will make you addict